pan></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是只有一个二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的一阶字母表，含标准变量和逻辑字母。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak G=\\langle G,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak G=\\langle G,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^{\\mathfrak G}=I(E)\">\\(E^{\\mathfrak G}=I(E)\\)</span>。路径是顶点的有限列，允许长度零路径。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}\\)</span> 限定无向无环图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connected}\">\\(\\mathrm{Connected}\\)</span> 见下式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak G\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;[\\neg E^{\\mathfrak G}(a,a)\\land(E^{\\mathfrak G}(a,b)\\leftrightarrow E^{\\mathfrak G}(b,a))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak G\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;[\\neg E^{\\mathfrak G}(a,a)\\land(E^{\\mathfrak G}(a,b)\\leftrightarrow E^{\\mathfrak G}(b,a))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connected}(\\mathfrak G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec v\\in G^{n+1}\\;[v_0=a\\land v_n=b\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;E^{\\mathfrak G}(v_i,v_{i+1})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Connected}(\\mathfrak G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec v\\in G^{n+1}\\;[v_0=a\\land v_n=b\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;E^{\\mathfrak G}(v_i,v_{i+1})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\\forall\\mathfrak G\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\to(\\mathfrak G\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Connected}(\\mathfrak G))\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\\forall\\mathfrak G\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\to(\\mathfrak G\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Connected}(\\mathfrak G))\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-maxcon","status":"resolved","id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-maxcon]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak G=\\langle G,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"E^{\\mathfrak G}=I(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Connected}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak G\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;[\\neg E^{\\mathfrak G}(a,a)\\land(E^{\\mathfrak G}(a,b)\\leftrightarrow E^{\\mathfrak G}(b,a))].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Connected}(\\mathfrak G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec v\\in G^{n+1}\\;[v_0=a\\land v_n=b\\land\\forall i<n\\;E^{\\mathfrak G}(v_i,v_{i+1})].","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\\forall\\mathfrak G\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Graph}(\\mathfrak G)\\to(\\mathfrak G\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Connected}(\\mathfrak G))\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1441,"backlinks":[{"id":"745fc0c979c72f17","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cup\\{E\\}$，$E$ 为唯一非逻辑符号，元数为二；无常量、函数。$\\mathrm{Graph}$、$\\mathrm{Connected}$ 取 [[57-thm-fo-cannot-express-connectivity]]，只比较非空无向简单图。对开公式的结构满足使用所有赋值的全称真值，不把 Fml 改成 Sent。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-276","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-downward-LS]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness]]\n[[57-thm-TP-monotone]]\n[[57-thm-acf-decidable]]\n[[57-thm-adequacy]]\n[[57-thm-assignment-composition]]\n[[57-thm-assignment-idempotent]]\n[[57-thm-back-and-forth-equivalence]]\n[[57-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[57-thm-birkhoff-variety]]\n[[57-thm-church-turing]]\n[[57-thm-church-undecidability]]\n[[57-thm-cnf-existence]]\n[[57-thm-coincidence-formula]]\n[[57-thm-coincidence-term]]\n[[57-thm-compactness]]\n[[57-thm-compactness-coloring]]\n[[57-thm-compactness-entailment]]\n[[57-thm-compactness-via-ultraproduct]]\n[[57-thm-completeness]]\n[[57-thm-completeness-cor]]\n[[57-thm-comp